OL,3,GNEWSASix routes taken off proposed list
OL,4,Aof Quiet Lanes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of roads being considered in
OL,7,FOxfordshire's Quiet Lanes programme has
OL,8,Fbeen reduced after six routes were
OL,9,Faxed.
OL,11,FThe scheme uses physical barriers to
OL,12,Fblock motor vehicles from using minor
OL,13,Froads to make space for safe walking,
OL,14,Fcycling and horse riding.
OL,16,FFor a route to be considered,
OL,17,Fcommunities need to approach the county
OL,18,Fcouncil, with the support of the local
OL,19,Fcouncillor. It is then assessed for
OL,20,Fsuitability.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,338,330,200,160,0,100
