OL,3,GNEWSASix routes taken off proposed list
OL,4,Aof Quiet Lanes
OL,5,
OL,6,FGareth Epps, Oxfordshire County
OL,7,FCouncil's cabinet member for transport,
OL,8,Fsaid five routes were removed after
OL,9,Fdiscussions with the parish council and
OL,10,Fa sixth "where the levels or type of
OL,11,Fthrough traffic did not warrant a quiet
OL,12,Flane scheme".
